Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,А
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,－ －
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...
