Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ә? Рика?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Доиташима Шите
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...
