Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Жоғары
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.87,0:11:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...
